{"file": "荒岛我为王，女神靠边站-第85集.mp4", "ep": 85, "duration": 76.0, "segments": [{"start": 6.7, "end": 7.42, "text": "一人一個"}, {"start": 7.98, "end": 9.34, "text": "我叫到明 誰才端"}, {"start": 9.62, "end": 10.7, "text": "六個蛋 六個人"}, {"start": 10.7, "end": 11.3, "text": "剛剛好"}, {"start": 11.74, "end": 15.42, "text": "那我的那個是哪個呀"}, {"start": 15.98, "end": 16.66, "text": "沒有指定"}, {"start": 17.06, "end": 18.34, "text": "叫到誰 誰來端"}, {"start": 22.94, "end": 23.58, "text": "最後一個"}, {"start": 24.96, "end": 25.68, "text": "為什麼呀"}, {"start": 27.22, "end": 28.42, "text": "因為你幹活最少唄"}, {"start": 28.94, "end": 30.37, "text": "我地柴了"}, {"start": 32.03, "end": 32.67, "text": "三根"}, {"start": 33.07, "end": 33.74, "text": "我看見了"}, {"start": 39.16, "end": 40.36, "text": "這招你上回用過了"}, {"start": 40.36, "end": 41.4, "text": "我可不會再上當"}, {"start": 41.76, "end": 65.98, "text": "都端上了"}, {"start": 66.26, "end": 66.86, "text": "小唐的呢"}, {"start": 67.38, "end": 68.18, "text": "櫃裡留著呢"}, {"start": 68.18, "end": 68.86, "text": "我這就撈"}, {"start": 73.29, "end": 73.77, "text": "蛋呢"}]}